			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Regenerate build artifacts and update RouteManifest timestamp\n\nRebuild all TypeScript compilation outputs in the `Target/` directory following the latest source modifications. This refreshes the generation timestamp in `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` from 2026-05-15T23:58:27Z to 2026-05-16T00:17:04Z to reflect the current build cycle.\n\nThe regeneration includes updated JavaScript bundles and source maps for the bootstrap entry points, gRPC server services, VS Code API handlers, and the dual-track routing logic. All intermediate build cache files (`.tsbuildinfo`) and generated manifest reports are synchronized to ensure the extension host sidecar is in a consistent state for the upcoming testing phase.",
